rganize and explain while testable code keeps authority over valuation formulas, cash flow, discounting, and versions.\",\"date_published\":\"2026-08-03T00:00:00.000Z\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"AI\",\"DCF\",\"Determinism\",\"Product\"]},{\"id\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/evidence-first-ai-research\",\"title\":\"Refresh evidence before asking the model to speak\",\"summary\":\"In company research, stale facts, duplicate jobs, and conclusions without a clear source usually cost more than tokens.\",\"date_published\":\"2026-08-06T00:00:00.000Z\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"AI\",\"Evidence\",\"Cloudflare\",\"Workflows\"]},{\"id\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/host-boundaries-in-one-next-deployment\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/host-boundaries-in-one-next-deployment\",\"title\":\"One Next.js deployment, two genuinely separate websites\",\"summary\":\"How one repository and one deployment can still keep custard.top and RocoDex as genuinely separate products.\",\"date_published\":\"2026-08-08T00:00:00.000Z\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"Next.js\",\"Architecture\",\"Testing\"]},{\"id\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/observable-dcf-pipeline\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/observable-dcf-pipeline\",\"title\":\"Why a market-wide DCF scan optimized cache JSON first\",\"summary\":\"A performance postmortem from a DCF scan: the hot path was repeated cache JSON handling, not the formula.\",\"date_published\":\"2026-07-30T00:00:00.000Z\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"Python\",\"Profiling\",\"Caching\",\"Data lineage\"]},{\"id\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/optimistic-locking-for-operations\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/optimistic-locking-for-operations\",\"title\":\"In a multi-user CRM, last write should not automatically win\",\"summary\":\"When two operators edit one CRM lead, make the conflict visible instead of letting the last submission erase the field record.\",\"date_published\":\"2026-07-26T00:00:00.000Z\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"CRM\",\"Concurrency\",\"RBAC\",\"D1\"]},{\"id\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/single-canvas-immersive-web\",\"url\":\"https://custard.top/en/notes/single-canvas-immersive-web\",\"title\":\"An immersive website needs only one 3D runtime\",\"summary\":\"For immersive visuals, keep headings, links, and scrolling as web semantics, then let one lazy canvas handle the sense of space.\",\"date_published\":\"2026-07-22T00:00:00.000Z\",\"date_modified\":\"2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"tags\":[\"Three.js\",\"Performance\",\"Accessibility\",\"Canvas\"]}]}"}